+* FEATURE: [vmagent](https://docs.victoriametrics.com/victoriametrics/vmagent/): add `scaleway_sd_configs` for automatic discovery of [Scaleway](https://www.scaleway.com/en/) Instances scrape targets. See [these docs](https://docs.victoriametrics.com/victoriametrics/sd_configs/#scaleway_sd_configs).
